        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrongly is a free poker themed roguelite deckbuilding game inspired by Balatro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a one card straight flush, blow up your whole deck with bombs, play seven card poker hands, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play poker hands to score points. Earning points quickly nets you chips. Run out of cards before reaching the score threshold, and that’s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can spend the chips you earned to make your run stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new cards to your deck, including special cards like the Lucky 7, which lets you take a spin on a slot machine that uses your deck as reels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zodiacs improve the power of all played hands that contain a certain hand. This allows you to transition to higher tier hands without losing your investment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baubles can change your run in major ways. Break the rules of poker with the Ladders, which allows for gaps in your straights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrongly features ten difficulty levels, boss rounds, a custom game creator, daily games with bizarre variants, and so much more! Are you ready to become the Scrongliest of all time?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrongly is a free poker themed roguelite deckbuilding game inspired by Balatro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a one card straight flush, blow up your whole deck with bombs, play seven card poker hands, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/f760a9b683120d4f9198de41007546cb.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play poker hands to score points. Earning points quickly nets you chips. Run out of cards before reaching the score threshold, and that’s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/045c4dfbc97d804573d775fcb623f30e.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can spend the chips you earned to make your run stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new cards to your deck, including special cards like the Lucky 7, which lets you take a spin on a slot machine that uses your deck as reels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zodiacs improve the power of all played hands that contain a certain hand. This allows you to transition to higher tier hands without losing your investment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baubles can change your run in major ways. Break the rules of poker with the Ladders, which allows for gaps in your straights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.poster.avif?t=1773234048\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.webm?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457930/extras/0fefb7caf04849d7980ac1178000cffb.mp4?t=1773234048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrongly features ten difficulty levels, boss rounds, a custom game creator, daily games with bizarre variants, and so much more! Are you ready to become the Scrongliest of all time?</p>",
